# core.bundle.js is a minified build artefact with a base64 payload on one line,
# and Windows clones default to autocrlf. Marking these binary keeps a checkout
# byte-identical to what was committed, which the preview page's byte-identity
# check depends on.
src/core.bundle.js binary
*.png binary

# Templates become C# and markdown in someone's project; leave the endings alone.
templates/* -text
